        "Enrico Costa",
        "Filippo Frontera",
        "Shrinivas R. Kulkarni"
      ],
      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Identifying gamma-ray burst afterglows and establishing their cosmological origin changed the interpretation of an energetic astrophysical phenomenon.",
        "attribution": "Costa and Frontera were central to the BeppoSAX observations that enabled afterglow detection; Kulkarni helped establish the optical follow-up and distance scale.",
        "maturity": "The cosmological nature of bursts is now well established and has supported a mature field of transient astrophysics.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The discovery depended on coordinated observations by many groups, making the division of credit among the proposed names difficult."
        ]
      }
    },
